5 EXPERIMENTS
Our extensive experiments (1) assess the performance of PQA to
demonstrate its optimality w.r.t. CR and success probability under
Proxy Quality assumption (§ 5.2), (2) assess the performance of
CSC to demonstrate its minimal oracle usage and success probability
under Core Set Closure assumption (§ 5.3), (3) compare PQE,
CSE with the baselines on CR and success probability under the
same oracle usage (§ 5.4) and under varied oracle budgets (§ 5.5). (4)
Compare PQE, CSE with the baselines w.r.t. query time (§ 5.6). (5)
Compare PQE, CSE with the baselines w.r.t. CPU overhead, CR, and
success probability on datasets of various sizes and domains (§ 5.7).
